%description:
Tests the AccECN option next to SACK blocks (RFC 9768 section 3.2.3.3): the
option has precedence over other options, but the receiver "MUST give
precedence to the SACK option" if fewer than two SACK blocks would fit. The
tester removes A028, A030 and A032, marks A034 CE and A036 ECT(1). With
timestamps, three SACK blocks leave no room for the option, so the ACKs from
B017 have two SACK blocks and the option with the fields that changed: EE0B,
then also ECEB, then also EE1B.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true
*.tcptester.script="a28 delete; a30 delete; a32 delete; a34 ce; a36 ect1"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.431 B015] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 25289 win 15372   Option(s): TS(1430,1424) SACK[26301,27313) NOP NOP NOP AccECN0(e0b=26301)
[1.431 B016] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 25289 win 15372   Option(s): TS(1430,1424) SACK[28325,29337)[26301,27313) NOP NOP NOP AccECN0(e0b=27313)
[1.431 B017] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 25289 win 15372   Option(s): TS(1430,1424) SACK[30349,31361)[28325,29337) NOP NOP NOP AccECN0(e0b=28325)
[1.431 B018] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 25289 win 15372   Option(s): TS(1430,1424) SACK[30349,32373)[28325,29337) AccECN0(e0b=28325,ceb=1012)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
